# Files that live in the repo but must never be served.
#
# Netlify needed three forced 404 redirects to hide these. Vercel does it
# better: anything listed here is not uploaded at all, so there is no file to
# reach rather than a file that 404s. If you add another maintainer-facing file
# to the repo, add it here in the same commit.

README.md
serve.ps1
assets/fonts/README.txt

# The Netlify configuration. Kept in the repo as a rollback path while the DNS
# cutover settles, but Vercel neither reads nor should serve it. Delete these
# three files, and this block, once bndrvids.com is confirmed on Vercel.
netlify.toml
_headers
_redirects
